  "description": "A vulnerability has been found in Portabilis i-Educar up to 2.10. This affects an unknown function of the file /intranet/educar_tipo_usuario_lst.php of the component Tipos de usu\u00e0rio Page. Such manipulation of the argument nm_tipo/descri\u00e7\u00e3o leads to sql injection. The attack may be performed from remote. The exploit has been disclosed to the public and may be used. Upgrading to version 2.12 mitigates this issue. Upgrading the affected component is advised. The vendor confirms: \"The reported attack vector was tested against the corrected code, and the previously described SQL Injection behavior could no longer be reproduced.\"",
